r":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"تحاول التاجرة المتسلطة (شفاعات) استغلال الشاب الريفي الساذج (إمام) الذي وفد حديثًا إلى القاهرة لإغوائه وإيقاعه في حبها على الرغم من أنه يصغرها سنًا، بينما يسعى كل من حولها إلى إبعاده عن طريقها، لكن يتغير كل شيء عندما يقع في حب فتاة شابة، حينها تشعر (شفاعات) بالغيرة وتخطط للانتقام منه.","description_en":"The domineering merchant Shafa't tries to exploit the naive rural young man Imam, who recently arrived in Cairo, to seduce him and make him fall in love with her even though he is younger than her. Everyone around her seeks to keep him out of her way, but everything changes when he falls in love with a young girl. Then Shafaa feels jealous and plans revenge on him.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k00CosikcvHUy9dgEWnLtH59pzg.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ta3zGRnjf3iLyeqiZvazcZJc0w.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"2025","release_date":"2025-03-16","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv247718","tv259909","tv56570","tv76773","tv2288","tv92967","tv4607","tv97951"],"director":"محمد سليمان عبدالمالك","cast":[{"name":"غادة عبدالرازق","character":"شفاعات","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/57KpAr5jKo8updReZSqig12LycM.jpg"},{"name":"يوسف عمر","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8gFoUQbHRFHMuQievHjVIB4zezR.jpg"},{"name":"محمود حافظ","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j3rqnfwdNttoKOoVUphD7APd9cy.jpg"},{"name":"محمد محمود","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9UIBmYQDSX8N0XZjOdRD5PpQMtl.jpg"},{"name":"جوري بكر","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5TjWERurM5UuFQRuLqRHoO38ybl.jpg"},{"name":"داليا شوقي","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rryZ7zatc5WUhuwk10JwoxEPZmJ.jpg"},{